  "headline": "Seven hours into hypercare for harbour-shop 2.4.0: one incident drafted (SEV2, checkout). A new TypeError in the cart summary, first seen in 2.4.0 and affecting 93 users, and a checkout error rate about five times the usual for the hour (2.0% against 0.4%) since the deploy. Search p95 latency was high for one hour after midnight and came back without action. The nightly export errors at 02:00 match every other night. No anomalies above the thresholds in orders."
